ghost-role-information-living-skeleton-name = Living skeleton
ghost-role-information-living-skeleton-description =
    You are a skeleton brought to life by space magic or a bluespace anomaly. You do not remember your life before death. Your goal is to survive until the end of the cycle.
ghost-role-information-living-skeleton-rules =
    You are a [bold]sapient living skeleton[/bold]. Your goal is to survive until the end of the cycle. This is a [color=yellow]neutral role[/color], not an antagonist: follow the conflict rules and do not attack others without a reason.
    You [color=red]DO NOT REMEMBER[/color] your previous life or anything you learned as a ghost. Do not return to your previous character's allies, enemies, or unfinished business.
    You can speak, use items, and wear ordinary clothing. You need no food, water, or air; milk repairs your bones on contact. Critical condition is not death: you can still be saved.
    Read [textlink="Skeleton species guide" link="LivingSkeleton"] and [textlink="Skeleton ghost role rules" link="EXRuleGhostRoleLivingSkeleton"].
